MyGo patch 0010 (VoxtMini): Options.Found.

A voice input app's window usually sits behind the app the user
dictates into; the update window popping up after the daily automatic
check took the focus at a bad time. Options.Found hears of a version an
automatic check found (not skipped, not to install without asking);
returning true says the app tells the user its own way (a note at the
foot of its sidebar): the window does not show, the check counts, and
CheckForUpdates shows the version as before. TestFound.
